[[file:Arcade Door.png|link=|Arcade door]]

An '''Arcade''' is a [[special room]] that can only spawn on an even-numbered floor ({{s|Basement}} II, {{s|Caves}} II, {{s|Depths}} II, {{s|Womb}} II) if you have 5 coins or more when you leave the previous floor. Arcades require one coin to be opened. They can be replaced with a {{R|Vault}} if Isaac is carrying two keys or more.

* Arcades cannot spawn on XL floors.
** {{dlc|r}} Unless it is on an alt path floor.
* {{dlc+|r}} Arcades can spawn on the first floor of the alternate chapters ({{s|Downpour}} I, {{s|Mines}} I, {{s|Mausoleum}} I, {{s|Corpse}} I).{{dlc-}}

