== Trivia ==
* The posters that can appear on the arcade's walls are pictures of games that Edmund McMillen has worked on, such as <u>Gish</u>, <u>Super Meat Boy</u>, and <u>Time Fcuk</u>.
* In the original <u>Binding of Isaac</u>, the arcade's icon was a 6-sided dice. In <u>Rebirth</u>, this icon was changed to a joystick.

